  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Aligns LibreWinForms 0.1.0-preview.43 with immutable LibreWPF 0.1.0-preview.43 and ProGPU 0.1.0-preview.53; builds the unchanged Microsoft DataGridView sample through LibreWinForms.Sdk with typed cell styles, painting/value events, custom cell templates and editors, virtual-mode callbacks, DataTable binding, and MaskedTextBox input; carries System.Resources.Extensions transitively so designer RESX payloads compile without application changes; validates hosted drawing contexts through the typed ProGpuDrawingContextState conversion without reflection; consumes ProGPU's compact retained picture, text, image, and readback paths; bounds retained formatted-text and drawing caches without increasing steady-frame allocations; preserves versioned designer serialization, Project Explorer/designer double-click counts, native popup-local Cocoa input, and interactive MenuStrip/ToolStrip/context-menu/dropdown placement; and retains typed X11/XWayland positioning, movement, dispatcher-pump, text, image, and scene-performance behavior.",
